# of the case, and what used to be TS2304 — but the re-exported namespace's
# members type as `any`, so an assignment from one is not rejected. A namespace
# import's target is a whole-module object, and ztsc does not synthesize its
# member types through a re-export hop. Deterministic under-report; the
# well-typed half (line 13, a member of a plain `export { X }` re-export) still
