module_aug/16_ambient_export_named_scope  -TS2322 entry.ts 14
# A NUMBER-literal key that names no member is not reported. The string-literal
# arm of element access reports the implicit-'any' miss (TS7053); the numeric
# arm falls back to the receiver's numeric index signature, which for an object
# without one is `any`, silently. Reporting there needs the numeric key space to
# be modelled as exactly as the named one is — arrays, tuples, enum-keyed maps
# and lib types all index numerically through paths ztsc approximates — so a
# "cannot index" verdict on this arm would be a false positive on correct code,
# which policy forbids. Deterministic under-report of one report; the ELEMENT
# TYPE the same access produces is exact (that is what lines 7, 11 and 19 pin,
# and what `constassert/006` as a whole is about).
constassert/006_template_expr_const_context_negatives.ts  -TS7053 16

# TS2344 decides a written type argument against its parameter's constraint
# only when that constraint is a PRIMITIVE OR LITERAL SET — a primitive, a
# literal, an enum member, `never`, or a union/intersection of those (see
# `decidableConstraintSet`). A STRUCTURAL constraint (`T extends
# ZodType<any, any, any>`) is left undecided: `isAssignable` answers it, but
# only as well as the relation does, and the relation currently rejects zod's
# `ZodNumber` against `ZodType<any, any, any>` — which as the sole evidence
# for a negative verdict is a false TS2344 on valid code. Same for an argument
# or constraint that is still a type variable or a deferred node (an `infer`
# binder, an unreduced conditional / indexed access / `keyof`): those are not
# sets ztsc can enumerate, and every one of the 130+ false TS2344s the
# unguarded check invented across the corpus was one of them.
#
# (tsc reports the structural miss on line 21 as TS2741 — the "property is
# missing" elaboration replaces the TS2344 head when the target is an object
# with a required member absent from the source.)
instantiation/052_type_arg_constraint_structural.ts  -TS2741 21
instantiation/052_type_arg_constraint_structural.ts  -TS2344 26
